 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음 나눗셈을 하시오.\n⑴ $15p^{3}q\\div 5pq^{3}$ ⑵ $-32x^{4}y^{2}\\div 8x^{3}y$\n⑶ $(-a^{3}b)^{3}\\div(-2a^{2}b)^{2}$ ⑷ $(3ab)^{2}\\div\\left(\\frac{1}{3}a^{2}b\\right)^{2}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $\\frac{3p^{2}}{q^{2}}$ ⑵ $-4xy$ ⑶ $-\\frac{a^{5}b}{4}$ ⑷ $\\frac{81}{a^{2}}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $\\frac{15p^{3}q}{5pq^{3}}=\\frac{3p^{2}}{q^{2}}$ ⑵ $\\frac{-32x^{4}y^{2}}{8x^{3}y}=-4xy$ ⑶ $(-a^{3}b)^{3}=-a^{9}b^{3}$, $(-2a^{2}b)^{2}=4a^{4}b^{2}$이므로 $-\\frac{a^{9}b^{3}}{4a^{4}b^{2}}=-\\frac{a^{5}b}{4}$ ⑷ $(3ab)^{2}=9a^{2}b^{2}$, $\\left(\\frac{1}{3}a^{2}b\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{9}a^{4}b^{2}$이므로 $9a^{2}b^{2}\\times\\frac{9}{a^{4}b^{2}}=\\frac{81}{a^{2}}$",
 "score": null,
